{"seq":2,"slug":"principles-randomization","title":"随机化-重复-区组三原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/foundations/principles-randomization","wordCount":2062,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"随机化-重复-区组三原则\">随机化-重复-区组三原则</h1><p>1923 年，Fisher 在洛桑农业试验站面对一块地：东边土壤肥沃、西边贫瘠，还要比较五个小麦品种。如果他把品种 A 全种在东边、品种 E 全种在西边，最后 A 产量高，谁也分不清是品种好还是土好。Fisher 的解法不是去消除土壤差异（做不到），而是发明了一套让结论依然可信的实验<strong>原理</strong>。随机化、重复、区组——这三条至今仍是一切实验设计的支柱，后面每一种设计本质上都是它们的组合落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三条原理各治一类问题，本文逐一确立：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>随机化</strong>（randomization）：把处理随机分配到实验单元上，使所有未被控制的干扰（已知的和未知的）的影响打散成与处理无关的随机噪声，让标准统计推断的前提（误差独立同分布）近似成立，并防止时间漂移与处理顺序混淆。</li>\n<li><strong>重复</strong>（replication）：对同一处理独立地做多次<strong>完整试验</strong>（区别于「重复测量」），用来估计误差方差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，为判断效应真伪提供标尺。</li>\n<li><strong>区组</strong>（blocking）：把已知且较大的干扰来源（如田块肥力梯度）划成相对均匀的区组，在每个区组内部完整地比较所有处理，从而缩小残差、提升 F 检验的灵敏度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>口诀是「能区组就区组，不能区组就随机化」（block what you can, randomize what you cannot）。三者的关系一句话：<strong>随机化管未知噪声、区组管已知大噪声、重复给误差一把尺</strong>，三原理叠加使用而非三选一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"随机化-把未知干扰变成可估的随机误差\">随机化：把未知干扰变成可估的随机误差</h2><p>随机化指把处理（treatment）随机地分配到实验单元上，而非按任何系统规律。它的作用不是让实验「更公平」这种含糊说法，而是有精确的统计后果：把所有<strong>未被控制的干扰因素</strong>（已知的和未知的）的影响打散成与处理无关的随机噪声，从而让标准的统计推断（t 检验、F 检验）的前提——误差独立同分布——近似成立。</p>\n<p>设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个单元的响应为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_i = \\tau_{t(i)} + u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是处理效应，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该单元固有的、我们不知道的偏移（土壤肥力、机台老化、操作员手法）。如果处理分配与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相关，效应估计就有偏。随机分配让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 独立，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的影响在处理间期望相互抵消，残留部分进入误差项被如实估计。换句话说，随机化是把「系统性偏差」转账为「随机误差」的机制——后者能被统计量诚实地量化，前者不能。</p>\n<p>随机化还防一类隐蔽陷阱：时间漂移。若按处理顺序依次跑实验，机器预热、试剂降解、人逐渐熟练都会与处理顺序混在一起。随机化运行顺序能把这种漂移摊到各处理上。这一点与 <a href=\"variables-factors\">因素与响应</a> 里区分「可控因素」与「噪声因素」的讨论直接相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重复-给误差一把标尺\">重复：给误差一把标尺</h2><p>重复（replication）指对同一处理独立地做多次完整试验。注意是「独立重复」而非「重复测量」——把同一个样品测三次只刻画了测量误差，把三个独立样品各测一次才刻画了实验误差。两者天差地别。</p>\n<p>重复的核心价值是估计误差方差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。没有重复，你能算出处理间的差异，却没有「噪声有多大」的基准，无从判断这差异是真信号还是运气。有了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重复，处理均值的标准误降为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>σ</mi><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{SE}(\\bar{y}) = \\frac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0376em;vertical-align:-0.93em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3097em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.93em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是为什么样本量翻四倍才能把精度提一倍。重复的第二个价值是缩小可检出的最小效应——这与 <a href=\"../practice/sample-size-power\">样本量与功效</a> 是同一枚硬币的两面：功效分析本质上就是在问「需要多少重复」。</p>\n<p>重复和「假重复」（pseudo-replication）的混淆是真实实验里最常见的统计错误之一。下表厘清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>变动的来源</th>\n<th>估计的是</th>\n<th>能否做处理间推断</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>真重复</td>\n<td>整个试验流程独立再来一遍</td>\n<td>实验误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复测量</td>\n<td>同一单元测多次</td>\n<td>测量误差</td>\n<td>不能（会高估自由度）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假重复</td>\n<td>同一处理下的多个子样本当独立</td>\n<td>子抽样误差</td>\n<td>不能（夸大显著性）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"区组-把已知的噪声隔离出去\">区组：把已知的噪声隔离出去</h2><p>随机化处理未知干扰，区组（blocking）处理<strong>已知且较大</strong>的干扰。Fisher 的农田有明显的肥力梯度——这是已知的大噪声，与其指望随机化把它摊匀（样本不够时摊不匀），不如主动把田分成若干肥力相近的「区组」，在每个区组内部完整地比较所有品种。区组内部相对均匀，处理对比因而更干净。</p>\n<p>区组的统计逻辑是把总变异分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>总变异</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>处理</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>区组</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>误差</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{总变异} = \\text{处理} + \\text{区组} + \\text{误差}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总变异</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">处理</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">区组</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">误差</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把区组变异单独拎出来，残差（误差）就变小，处理效应的 F 检验更敏感。代价是每个区组要容纳所有处理——当处理太多、区组容量不够时，就需要不完全区组设计，并把某些高阶交互<strong>主动</strong>混杂到区组上。这正是 <a href=\"../designs/blocking-confounding\">区组与混杂</a> 的主题，本篇只确立原理：区组 = 隔离已知噪声以换取处理对比的精度。</p>\n<p>区组的口诀是「能区组就区组，不能区组就随机化」（block what you can, randomize what you cannot）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[干扰因素] --&gt; B{是否已知&lt;br/&gt;且影响大?}&#10;  B --&gt;|已知大| C[区组&lt;br/&gt;主动隔离]&#10;  B --&gt;|未知/零散| D[随机化&lt;br/&gt;摊成随机误差]&#10;  C --&gt; E[残差变小&lt;br/&gt;F检验更敏感]&#10;  D --&gt; F[推断前提成立&lt;br/&gt;无系统偏差]&#10;  E --&gt; G[结论可信]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  H[想知道噪声多大?] --&gt; I[重复&lt;br/&gt;估计sigma^2]&#10;  I --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[干扰因素] --&gt; B{是否已知&lt;br/&gt;且影响大?}\n  B --&gt;|已知大| C[区组&lt;br/&gt;主动隔离]\n  B --&gt;|未知/零散| D[随机化&lt;br/&gt;摊成随机误差]\n  C --&gt; E[残差变小&lt;br/&gt;F检验更敏感]\n  D --&gt; F[推断前提成立&lt;br/&gt;无系统偏差]\n  E --&gt; G[结论可信]\n  F --&gt; G\n  H[想知道噪声多大?] --&gt; I[重复&lt;br/&gt;估计sigma^2]\n  I --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"三原理如何协同-一个微型设计\">三原理如何协同：一个微型设计</h2><p>把三者放进一个例子。要比较 4 种催化剂对产率的影响，原料分 3 个批次（批次间有已知差异）。设计：每个批次（区组）内把 4 种催化剂各做 2 次（重复），同一批次内的 8 次试验<strong>随机</strong>排序。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>区组（批次）吸收了原料批间差异；</li>\n<li>重复（每催化剂 2 次/批）给出误差估计；</li>\n<li>随机化运行顺序防止批次内的时间漂移与催化剂混淆。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最终的 ANOVA 把平方和分成催化剂、批次、误差三块，催化剂效应的检验因区组而更灵敏、因重复而有标尺、因随机化而无偏。三原理不是三选一，而是叠加使用——这一思路会在 <a href=\"../designs/factorial-designs\">析因设计</a> 和 <a href=\"../analysis/anova-effects\">方差分析与效应</a> 里反复出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代延伸-受限随机化与在线实验\">现代延伸：受限随机化与在线实验</h2><p>三原理在 2026 年依然是底座，但有了新形态。完全随机化在某些场景成本太高——比如「炉温」这类难改的因素不可能每次试验都重设，于是有<strong>裂区设计</strong>（split-plot）的受限随机化：难改因素在大区上随机、易改因素在小区上随机。在线 AB 测试则把随机化做到极致（按用户哈希随机分流），但常常无法重复（每个用户只经历一个版本）也难以区组，这正是 <a href=\"../practice/doe-vs-ab-testing\">与 AB 测试对比</a> 要厘清的边界。原理不变，约束变了，设计随之而变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>随机化把未知干扰从「系统偏差」转为「随机误差」，使标准推断的前提成立，并防时间漂移。</li>\n<li>重复（独立的，非重复测量）提供误差方差的估计，是判断信号真伪的标尺，与样本量/功效同源。</li>\n<li>区组主动隔离已知的大噪声来源，缩小残差、提升 F 检验灵敏度，代价是可能需要混杂高阶交互。</li>\n<li>三原理叠加使用，而非三选一；ANOVA 把它们对应的变异分别分解出来。</li>\n<li>裂区、在线实验等现代场景改变了约束，但仍以这三条原理为底座。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>把区组推到设计层面、主动混杂高阶交互：<a href=\"../designs/blocking-confounding\">区组与混杂</a></li>\n<li>「需要多少重复」的定量回答：<a href=\"../practice/sample-size-power\">样本量与功效</a></li>\n<li>互联网实验里随机化的不同实现：<a href=\"../../../data-science/ab-testing-statistics/experiment-design/randomization-methods\">AB 测试的随机化方法</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"随机化-重复-区组三原则","id":"随机化-重复-区组三原则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"随机化：把未知干扰变成可估的随机误差","id":"随机化-把未知干扰变成可估的随机误差"},{"level":2,"text":"重复：给误差一把标尺","id":"重复-给误差一把标尺"},{"level":2,"text":"区组：把已知的噪声隔离出去","id":"区组-把已知的噪声隔离出去"},{"level":2,"text":"三原理如何协同：一个微型设计","id":"三原理如何协同-一个微型设计"},{"level":2,"text":"现代延伸：受限随机化与在线实验","id":"现代延伸-受限随机化与在线实验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何需要实验设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/foundations/why-experimental-design"},"next":{"title":"因素与响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/foundations/variables-factors"}}